Given that $P =$ {multiples of 3} and $Q =$ {positive even numbers} are subsets of $\mu$ = {$x : 1 < x \le 20$, where $x$ is a counting number}:

(i) list the elements in $P \cap Q$;

(ii) list all the subsets in $P \cap Q$.

answer:
**(i)** Combine the right side into one fraction, then invert both sides:

$$
\begin{aligned}
\frac{1}{y} &= \frac{3kx - 2}{x} \\
y &= \frac{x}{3kx - 2}
\end{aligned}
$$

**(ii)** Substitute $x = -1$ and $k = 2$:

$$y = \frac{-1}{3(2)(-1) - 2} = \frac{-1}{-8} = \frac{1}{8}$$

